---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Base title="Flat-Fee Bid Pricing | Tidewater" description="Transparent flat-fee government bid support for hospitality and service operators. No hidden payment model.">
<section class="section"><div class="container alt-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h1>Know the fee before we start.</h1><p class="lead">Flat fees, scoped to the job. We review the solicitation before agreeing on the specific amount in each range.</p></div></section>
<section class="section narrow"><div class="container"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Estimated contract value</th><th scope="col">Bid preparation fee</th><th scope="col">Scope</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Under $100,000</td><td class="mono"><strong>$250–$500 per bid</strong></td><td>Opportunity review, checklist, and drafted response.</td></tr><tr><td>$100,000–$1 million</td><td class="mono"><strong>$1,500–$3,000 per bid</strong></td><td>Deeper pricing review, document coordination and drafted response.</td></tr><tr><td>Over $1 million</td><td class="mono"><strong>Quoted retainer or six-month engagement</strong></td><td>Multi-stage preparation and coordination, scoped in writing.</td></tr><tr><td>Post-award implementation</td><td class="mono"><strong>Monthly retainer, quoted</strong></td><td>Launch operations, staffing ramp and compliance setup.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="grid-2 inset"><div class="panel"><h3>The template is yours.</h3><p>Your upfront bid fee includes the bid template. You keep the template and can use it for later opportunities.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>What may change the quote?</h3><p>The number of required attachments, technical complexity, required site visits, time until the deadline and coordination with your team.</p></div></div><p class="fine">Contract value means the estimated size of the agency work, not the amount of our fee. Agency filing charges, if any, are separate and disclosed before engagement.</p></div></section>
<CTA title="Start with one real opportunity." body="Send us the solicitation or tell us about your business. We will review the fit before quoting the work."/>
</Base>
